  "name": "Along came Love",
  "description": "Vino el amor is a Mexican telenovela produced by José Alberto Castro for Televisa and originally broadcast on Las Estrellas from August 8, 2016, to February 19, 2017. It is based on the Chilean telenovela La Chúcara, created by Víctor Carrasco.  The story follows Luciana Muñoz, a young woman who travels to California in search of a better life and begins working at a vineyard owned by David Robles. As they fall in love, they must overcome family conflicts, personal tragedies, and the challenges that threaten their future together.",
